1
00:01:41,830 --> 00:01:48,970
[Genius Girlfriend]

2
00:01:49,390 --> 00:01:51,960
[Episode 21]

3
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:06,480
Do you still remember
that insanely difficult

4
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:08,960
last question from
that year's college entrance exam?

5
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:11,020
What was the examiner even thinking?

6
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,380
That last question...

7
00:02:15,150 --> 00:02:16,710
I think I vaguely remember it.

8
00:02:16,710 --> 00:02:18,590
It's not hard
once you substitute in logarithms.

9
00:02:18,590 --> 00:02:19,400
Easy for you.

10
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:20,960
That question

11
00:02:21,030 --> 00:02:23,160
definitely stumped a lot of students.

12
00:02:23,320 --> 00:02:24,910
Didn't you say before,

13
00:02:25,470 --> 00:02:27,310
"After each exam, put it behind you.

14
00:02:27,310 --> 00:02:28,630
Once they're all over, let them go.

15
00:02:28,630 --> 00:02:30,470
Don't dwell on it. Just look ahead."

16
00:02:30,470 --> 00:02:31,280
Yeah.

17
00:02:31,750 --> 00:02:33,350
So you need to look ahead too.

18
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:35,530
Don't keep staring down at the ground.

19
00:02:35,590 --> 00:02:36,280
Try it.

20
00:02:37,710 --> 00:02:38,120
Come on.

21
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:38,470
Okay.

22
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:40,570
Come on, go.

23
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,079
Get lower.

24
00:02:44,079 --> 00:02:45,140
Keep your balance.

25
00:02:46,310 --> 00:02:47,190
Look ahead.

26
00:02:47,750 --> 00:02:48,680
Don't look back.

27
00:02:49,470 --> 00:02:50,329
I'm right here.

28
00:02:51,310 --> 00:02:53,570
Jiang Yubai, look, I can skateboard now!

29
00:03:34,740 --> 00:03:38,320
[Inpatient]

30
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:41,470
Director.

31
00:03:41,630 --> 00:03:42,400
Come in.

32
00:03:44,630 --> 00:03:45,310
Sit.

33
00:03:49,190 --> 00:03:49,870
Shen,

34
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:51,079
Dr. Huang

35
00:03:51,079 --> 00:03:52,740
has other duties to attend to.

36
00:03:53,030 --> 00:03:55,430
As for Shui's routine checkups

37
00:03:55,450 --> 00:03:56,380
and ward rounds,

38
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:58,079
you'll take care of those for now.

39
00:03:57,430 --> 00:03:58,590
[Assessment and Plan for Today]

40
00:03:58,620 --> 00:04:01,080
[Examining Physician's Signature]

41
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:02,470
She's had

42
00:04:02,590 --> 00:04:05,250
8 different examining doctors
in just 6 months?

43
00:04:05,590 --> 00:04:06,560
In our department,

44
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:07,400
examining doctors

45
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:09,330
are supposed to rotate regularly.

46
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:11,120
You just started your residency here.

47
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,080
Learning more

48
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:13,280
about different diseases

49
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,240
will do you good.

50
00:04:15,190 --> 00:04:17,630
Do I need to attend the case discussions?

51
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:22,240
Examining doctors don't need to.

52
00:04:25,950 --> 00:04:26,630
Director,

53
00:04:27,390 --> 00:04:28,950
APL is a rare disease,

54
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:31,240
so I'd like to study it in depth.

55
00:04:35,870 --> 00:04:36,510
Alright.

56
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:43,730
[Doctor's signature, Shen Fuxuan]

57
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:46,360
Shen,

58
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,159
Shui

59
00:04:48,430 --> 00:04:49,630
is a bit of a princess.

60
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,680
Be mindful of your approach

61
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:52,950
when treating her.

62
00:04:55,430 --> 00:04:57,030
Okay, I'll keep that in mind.

63
00:04:58,390 --> 00:04:59,750
Director, I'll get back to work then.

64
00:04:59,750 --> 00:05:00,430
Okay.

65
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:10,040
The teacher asked me
to bring these to you.

66
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:11,270
Read them when you have time

67
00:05:11,270 --> 00:05:13,930
so you won't fall too far behind
in your studies.

68
00:05:14,750 --> 00:05:15,750
Leave them there.

69
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,600
So annoying.

70
00:05:17,870 --> 00:05:19,430
I'm already stuck lying here.

71
00:05:19,430 --> 00:05:21,630
How am I supposed to feel like studying?

72
00:05:22,270 --> 00:05:25,200
No need to guess.
It was definitely my parents' idea.

73
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:31,870
Then let me show you something good.

74
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:36,270
What is it?

75
00:05:36,630 --> 00:05:38,720
Our class has a new intern teacher,

76
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:39,430
Mr. Wang.

77
00:05:39,510 --> 00:05:40,950
He's very handsome.

78
00:05:41,310 --> 00:05:42,120
Look.

79
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:44,510
Hurry up and get better.

80
00:05:44,510 --> 00:05:45,870
Then you can see him
when you go back to school.

81
00:05:45,870 --> 00:05:46,680
This guy?

82
00:05:47,430 --> 00:05:48,630
Only someone like you

83
00:05:48,630 --> 00:05:49,890
who hasn't met many men

84
00:05:50,460 --> 00:05:51,920
would think he's all that.

85
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,210
As if you've seen that many.

86
00:06:07,510 --> 00:06:08,510
What do you think?

87
00:06:11,190 --> 00:06:13,910
He looks like a runway model.

88
00:06:13,950 --> 00:06:15,970
And his name is so nice too—

89
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:17,390
Shen Fuxuan.

90
00:06:17,830 --> 00:06:20,430
It means "basking in the sun in winter

91
00:06:20,510 --> 00:06:22,710
and bathing in spring water in summer."

92
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:24,160
How cultured.

93
00:06:24,700 --> 00:06:25,920
Yeah, sure.

94
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:28,020
He really is pretty handsome.

95
00:06:28,270 --> 00:06:29,160
However,

96
00:06:29,630 --> 00:06:31,000
Mr. Wang

97
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:33,100
graduated from Qingbei University.

98
00:06:33,390 --> 00:06:34,680
Where did

99
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:36,510
this Dr. Shen of yours graduate from?

100
00:06:36,510 --> 00:06:37,870
Oh, him?

101
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:40,750
Nothing special.

102
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:43,290
Johns Hopkins School of Medicine.

103
00:06:43,870 --> 00:06:44,950
Really?

104
00:06:48,510 --> 00:06:49,800
Then, is he...

105
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:50,720
single?

106
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:52,830
I don't know either.

107
00:06:52,830 --> 00:06:53,480
You...

108
00:06:57,870 --> 00:06:58,510
Shui,

109
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,750
starting today,

110
00:06:59,750 --> 00:07:02,040
I'll be responsible for
your routine checkups.

111
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,320
Really, Dr. Shen?

112
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,160
You agreed with Director Zhou

113
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:06,960
that you'd handle
my routine checkups from now on?

114
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:08,430
That's great.

115
00:07:08,830 --> 00:07:10,770
I'll take you for a blood test now.

116
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:11,870
Let's go.

117
00:07:43,430 --> 00:07:45,310
Hello, are you Jiang Yubai?

118
00:07:47,159 --> 00:07:47,870
Yes.

119
00:07:48,390 --> 00:07:49,450
What's the matter?

120
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:53,310
This is my badge.

121
00:07:53,870 --> 00:07:54,680
There is something

122
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:56,120
we need to confirm with you.

123
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:58,120
We'd appreciate your cooperation.

124
00:07:59,430 --> 00:08:00,120
Okay.

125
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:25,980
Something came up.

126
00:08:26,310 --> 00:08:27,640
Let's meet another day.

127
00:08:31,980 --> 00:08:36,900
[Okay.]

128
00:09:05,510 --> 00:09:07,640
Do you know why we brought you in today?

129
00:09:10,510 --> 00:09:11,600
Don't be nervous.

130
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,600
It's just a routine inquiry.

131
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:14,960
Recently,

132
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:16,600
a batch of rebranded speakers

133
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:18,130
has appeared on the market.

134
00:09:18,390 --> 00:09:21,030
They look almost
exactly like the originals.

135
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:23,080
We traced them back to the source

136
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:25,120
and found a guy named Cheng.

137
00:09:25,870 --> 00:09:27,400
Take a look at these photos.

138
00:09:33,380 --> 00:09:33,980
Jiang,

139
00:09:34,030 --> 00:09:35,600
they're really not for private labeling.

140
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:37,630
They will never end up on the market.

141
00:09:38,550 --> 00:09:40,550
It's just that some vain rich kids

142
00:09:41,510 --> 00:09:42,720
want something unique,

143
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:45,580
with a mystery to it
they can't quite put into words.

144
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:51,720
I guarantee
it won't damage your reputation.

145
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:53,650
And this order is very profitable.

146
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:57,800
It'd also get you out of the tight spot
you're in right now.

147
00:09:58,750 --> 00:10:01,000
[Repayment Plan for the Next Three Months]

148
00:10:04,480 --> 00:10:05,240
Officer.

149
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:08,380
Cheng is my business partner.

150
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:09,860
Our workshop's

151
00:10:09,910 --> 00:10:12,310
operating model is actually quite simple.

152
00:10:12,630 --> 00:10:14,430
Cheng is mainly responsible for

153
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:16,030
communicating with clients

154
00:10:16,030 --> 00:10:17,490
and selling our products.

155
00:10:18,150 --> 00:10:20,870
I'm mainly responsible for
the technology and production.

156
00:10:20,870 --> 00:10:22,200
I'm almost never involved in

157
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:23,860
the front-end sales process.

158
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,360
About 2 weeks ago...

159
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:31,800
Cheng did mention an urgent order to me.

160
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:33,900
The quantity was quite large,

161
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:36,000
but there was a special requirement.

162
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:38,510
That is, none of the products could have

163
00:10:38,510 --> 00:10:40,510
our workshop's logo or mark on them.

164
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:42,630
I explicitly asked him at the time

165
00:10:42,630 --> 00:10:44,510
what this batch of products was for.

166
00:10:44,510 --> 00:10:45,870
But he assured me

167
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:49,460
it was solely based on
the customer's personal preference

168
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:54,890
and that there was absolutely no risk
of rebranding or counterfeiting involved.

169
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:57,030
We've trusted each other for years,

170
00:10:58,360 --> 00:11:00,160
so I didn't look into it further.

171
00:11:03,030 --> 00:11:05,150
So, what you're saying is...

172
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:08,150
you had no knowledge of this matter?

173
00:11:08,510 --> 00:11:09,270
Yes.

174
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:12,720
You can ask Cheng
for the customer's information

175
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:14,480
and details of the order.

176
00:11:26,100 --> 00:11:26,650
Okay.

177
00:11:36,720 --> 00:11:37,360
We basically

178
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:38,720
have a clear picture of what happened.

179
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:39,920
That's all for today.

180
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:42,750
We'll be in touch
if there's anything further.

181
00:11:42,750 --> 00:11:44,150
Get a family member to sign the paperwork,

182
00:11:44,150 --> 00:11:45,480
and then you can go home.

183
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:53,000
Family...

184
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:56,930
I don't have any family.

185
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:03,390
Then...

186
00:12:04,150 --> 00:12:05,270
call a friend.

187
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:08,490
I...

188
00:12:09,510 --> 00:12:11,240
Don't have any friends either?

189
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:22,960
Officer,

190
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:25,500
I'd like to make a call.

191
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:38,840
-Hello, officer.
-Hello.

192
00:12:38,870 --> 00:12:39,750
I'm looking for Jiang Yubai.

193
00:12:39,750 --> 00:12:40,510
I'm his friend.

194
00:12:40,510 --> 00:12:41,510
He just called me.

195
00:12:43,490 --> 00:12:45,600
[Loyalty, Service to the People,
Professionalism, Efficiency]

196
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:45,660
This lady is looking for Jiang Yubai.

197
00:12:45,840 --> 00:12:47,900
You're Jiang Yubai's friend, right?

198
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:48,870
Yes.

199
00:12:49,150 --> 00:12:50,510
We're just following routine procedure

200
00:12:50,510 --> 00:12:51,270
and conducting an inquiry.

201
00:12:51,270 --> 00:12:52,390
It's finished now.

202
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:54,030
Please sign here,

203
00:12:54,030 --> 00:12:55,430
and you can take him home.

204
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:02,400
Thank you for your cooperation.

205
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:03,630
Let's go.

206
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:16,750
Lin Zhixia...

207
00:13:16,750 --> 00:13:18,720
Jiang Yubai, I need to commend you.

208
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:20,510
Commend you?

209
00:13:21,260 --> 00:13:22,520
You've made progress.

210
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:25,750
When you texted

211
00:13:25,750 --> 00:13:27,280
about meeting another day,

212
00:13:27,510 --> 00:13:30,040
weren't you trying to
hide this from me again?

213
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:33,750
But in the end,
you still let me come pick you up.

214
00:13:34,390 --> 00:13:36,000
That's real progress.

215
00:13:37,600 --> 00:13:38,360
So,

216
00:13:39,270 --> 00:13:40,600
as a reward...

217
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:45,370
Strawberry crepes.

218
00:13:46,510 --> 00:13:47,570
You must be hungry.

219
00:14:03,030 --> 00:14:04,090
Just what I needed.

220
00:14:05,270 --> 00:14:06,330
I really am hungry.

221
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:08,850
Is it good?

222
00:14:09,600 --> 00:14:11,360
I just bought them from a random shop.

223
00:14:11,360 --> 00:14:12,750
Have something to hold you over for now.

224
00:14:12,750 --> 00:14:13,600
It's good.

225
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:15,720
Next time, I'll take you
to a place I've been to.

226
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:16,980
Their food is good too.

227
00:14:18,510 --> 00:14:19,200
Okay.

228
00:14:31,510 --> 00:14:32,270
What?

229
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:47,130
You got cream on you.

230
00:14:49,180 --> 00:14:54,590
♪ Only for this lingering warmth
of the moment ♪

231
00:14:56,310 --> 00:15:02,110
♪ Trading souls with the night ♪

232
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:08,900
♪ Every dusk I have stolen ♪

233
00:15:08,920 --> 00:15:10,130
You got some there too.

234
00:15:10,130 --> 00:15:16,150
♪ Foretells a parting ♪

235
00:15:13,840 --> 00:15:14,720
No, I didn't.

236
00:15:15,720 --> 00:15:17,510
Yeah, a big smudge.

237
00:15:18,450 --> 00:15:24,860
♪ Where did the storm start brewing ♪

238
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:20,960
You're lying.

239
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:22,840
How could I lie to you?

240
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:25,720
Then you got some here too.

241
00:15:25,530 --> 00:15:31,110
♪ Drenching you before we knew it? ♪

242
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:27,840
Here too.

243
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:29,720
And here too.

244
00:15:31,920 --> 00:15:34,730
♪ Let me draw near to you ♪

245
00:15:35,380 --> 00:15:38,410
♪ Let me imagine you ♪

246
00:15:38,900 --> 00:15:41,090
♪ Let me sink into your ♪

247
00:15:41,530 --> 00:15:45,150
♪ Scattered golden glow ♪

248
00:15:45,920 --> 00:15:48,260
♪ Let the night blur your figure ♪

249
00:15:49,240 --> 00:15:51,970
♪ Yet tear myself away from you ♪

250
00:15:52,740 --> 00:15:55,170
♪ I can't fathom why ♪

251
00:15:58,080 --> 00:15:59,150
-Su Mo!
-Su Mo!

252
00:15:59,210 --> 00:16:01,030
Su, whatever it is, you can tell us!

253
00:16:01,030 --> 00:16:02,200
We'll help you figure something out!

254
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:03,120
Don't do this!

255
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:03,840
Su Mo!

256
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:04,480
On the rooftop.

257
00:16:04,480 --> 00:16:05,410
Yeah, that's it.

258
00:16:05,630 --> 00:16:06,630
-Tingting.
-Tingting.

259
00:16:06,630 --> 00:16:07,360
Tingting.

260
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:09,360
-Tingting.
-Tingting, you're finally here.

261
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:10,390
Your Su Mo is going to
jump off the building.

262
00:16:09,860 --> 00:16:15,010
[Star Shine Media]

263
00:16:10,390 --> 00:16:11,750
You need to go to the rooftop right now.

264
00:16:11,750 --> 00:16:12,240
Go take a look.

265
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:13,150
-He's jumping off the building.
-Let's go.

266
00:16:13,150 --> 00:16:14,410
Jump off the building?

267
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:16,510
-Su Mo, calm down!
-Su Mo!

268
00:16:16,510 --> 00:16:17,360
Yeah, whatever you need,

269
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,270
the company will make sure you get it!

270
00:16:18,270 --> 00:16:19,630
Don't do anything stupid!

271
00:16:19,630 --> 00:16:20,390
Su Mo, what are you doing?

272
00:16:20,390 --> 00:16:21,520
Come down right now!

273
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:29,150
Wei Ningning.

274
00:16:29,150 --> 00:16:30,280
Who is Wei Ningning?

275
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:32,470
If I jump from here,

276
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:34,750
will I no longer have to endure

277
00:16:34,750 --> 00:16:36,480
all the pain you've brought me?

278
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:37,390
Who is he talking about?

279
00:16:37,390 --> 00:16:38,360
No idea.

280
00:16:40,120 --> 00:16:40,960
I know.

281
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:43,720
I know everything.

282
00:16:45,030 --> 00:16:46,490
As long as I jump from here,

283
00:16:47,510 --> 00:16:49,360
all that pain will disappear.

284
00:16:51,200 --> 00:16:52,860
It's fine. You can go back now.

285
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:54,360
Su Mo, get down!

286
00:16:54,720 --> 00:16:56,850
I'll go over that scene with you again.

287
00:16:58,120 --> 00:16:59,270
He's just practicing his lines.

288
00:16:59,270 --> 00:17:00,870
It's nothing. It's nothing.

289
00:17:01,910 --> 00:17:02,870
He scared the hell out of me.

290
00:17:02,870 --> 00:17:04,200
Let's go back. Let's go.

291
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:12,680
You brat,

292
00:17:13,069 --> 00:17:14,670
you scared the wits out of me.

293
00:17:16,550 --> 00:17:17,920
I just couldn't find the right feeling

294
00:17:17,920 --> 00:17:19,240
for that scene,

295
00:17:19,829 --> 00:17:21,690
so I thought I'd try it out myself.

296
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:23,800
Tingting, you know what?

297
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:25,960
The moment I turned my head just now,

298
00:17:26,589 --> 00:17:28,450
I truly felt like I had become him.

299
00:17:43,680 --> 00:17:46,480
Your emotional delivery just now
was pretty good.

300
00:17:46,510 --> 00:17:47,920
But that last part,

301
00:17:48,160 --> 00:17:49,890
you could tone it down a little.

302
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:58,240
Mr. Li, I'm not going to manage Bingbing.

303
00:17:58,240 --> 00:17:59,240
I'll definitely make Su Mo

304
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:01,040
one of the best actors out there.

305
00:18:04,440 --> 00:18:05,070
Tingting.

306
00:18:05,920 --> 00:18:07,180
What are you busy with?

307
00:18:09,750 --> 00:18:10,510
Nothing.

308
00:18:11,240 --> 00:18:12,030
I'm telling you,

309
00:18:12,030 --> 00:18:13,680
you need to step up your game from now on.

310
00:18:13,680 --> 00:18:15,340
I've sacrificed a lot for you.

311
00:18:18,200 --> 00:18:20,000
Go get everyone some coffee or something.

312
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:21,550
You scared everyone half to death
just now.

313
00:18:21,550 --> 00:18:22,200
Okay.

314
00:18:23,640 --> 00:18:24,160
Got it.

315
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:25,640
Don't ever do that again.

316
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:26,510
Got it!

317
00:18:33,510 --> 00:18:35,200
We're holding a welcome dinner
for Shen tonight.

318
00:18:35,200 --> 00:18:36,600
Don't forget, everyone.

319
00:18:39,310 --> 00:18:42,570
Alright, whoever's late today
gets punished with a drink.

320
00:18:49,920 --> 00:18:51,160
It's been a long time, Shen!

321
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:52,720
-It's been a long time.
-You're here.

322
00:18:52,720 --> 00:18:53,830
Tang,

323
00:18:54,030 --> 00:18:55,590
all dressed up so nicely

324
00:18:55,720 --> 00:18:56,790
for Shen's welcome dinner?

325
00:18:56,790 --> 00:18:58,240
Do you really need to be this formal?

326
00:18:58,240 --> 00:19:00,970
Mind your own business.
I didn't dress up for you.

327
00:19:01,720 --> 00:19:02,400
You two

328
00:19:02,400 --> 00:19:04,530
haven't changed a bit all these years.

329
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:08,330
Where's Lin Zhixia?

330
00:19:08,750 --> 00:19:09,920
She's rarely late.

331
00:19:11,960 --> 00:19:13,510
Traffic might be a bit heavy at this hour.

332
00:19:13,510 --> 00:19:14,240
No rush.

333
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:18,400
Jin Baihui,

334
00:19:18,550 --> 00:19:20,510
you've spent more than 10 years in school.

335
00:19:20,510 --> 00:19:22,110
Aren't you bored with it yet?

336
00:19:22,440 --> 00:19:23,350
I'm used to it.

337
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:25,440
Besides, it suits me.

338
00:19:25,680 --> 00:19:26,540
What about you?

339
00:19:26,590 --> 00:19:28,160
Are you in your comfort zone now?

340
00:19:28,160 --> 00:19:29,590
I wouldn't call it my comfort zone.

341
00:19:29,590 --> 00:19:32,270
It's more like my domain.

342
00:19:35,200 --> 00:19:35,920
Shen,

343
00:19:36,270 --> 00:19:38,680
well, is there any fundamental difference

344
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:39,960
between seeing patients abroad

345
00:19:39,960 --> 00:19:41,920
and seeing patients here in China?

346
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:43,440
Tell us about it.

347
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:52,440
Shen.

348
00:19:55,510 --> 00:19:56,570
After coming back,

349
00:19:56,590 --> 00:19:59,050
are you settling in well
at the new hospital?

350
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:00,300
I can handle it.

351
00:20:01,510 --> 00:20:03,170
I mostly just missed you guys.

352
00:20:03,200 --> 00:20:03,920
Come on.

353
00:20:03,920 --> 00:20:05,240
Please, cut it out.

354
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:08,590
Traffic was bad, so I'm late.

355
00:20:08,590 --> 00:20:09,590
Sorry about that.

356
00:20:10,680 --> 00:20:11,410
You're here.

357
00:20:11,510 --> 00:20:12,590
Shen Fuxuan.

358
00:20:13,790 --> 00:20:15,190
Welcome back to the team.

359
00:20:18,510 --> 00:20:20,510
I've brought a surprise for you all.

360
00:20:28,790 --> 00:20:29,680
Jiang?

361
00:20:30,160 --> 00:20:30,960
Jiang Yubai?

362
00:20:32,960 --> 00:20:34,400
You finally showed up!

363
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:36,250
I've missed you so much.

364
00:20:38,310 --> 00:20:40,770
Where on earth
have you been all these years?

365
00:20:40,920 --> 00:20:42,750
You just left us all hanging there

366
00:20:42,750 --> 00:20:43,790
without any explanation

367
00:20:43,790 --> 00:20:44,960
and then abandoned us

368
00:20:44,960 --> 00:20:46,220
like we didn't matter.

369
00:20:49,510 --> 00:20:50,310
Feel my heart.

370
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:51,720
It's

371
00:20:52,310 --> 00:20:54,200
freezing cold and empty.

372
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:57,200
Duan Qiyan, you're so cheesy.

373
00:20:58,000 --> 00:20:59,030
Jiang Yubai,

374
00:20:59,070 --> 00:21:00,440
we have to punish you today.

375
00:21:00,440 --> 00:21:02,840
You'd better figure out
how to handle this.

376
00:21:03,860 --> 00:21:05,170
Sorry, guys.

377
00:21:05,510 --> 00:21:06,720
I'm late.

378
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:09,000
Come sit down.

379
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:11,160
Yeah, at least you showed up.

380
00:21:11,510 --> 00:21:13,070
-Sit, everybody.
-You girls take the inside seats.

381
00:21:13,070 --> 00:21:14,200
I missed you so much.

382
00:21:15,310 --> 00:21:17,110
Waiter, another chair, please!

383
00:21:38,790 --> 00:21:39,990
It's been a long time.

384
00:21:42,240 --> 00:21:43,770
Yeah, it's been a long time.

385
00:21:44,270 --> 00:21:45,070
You...

386
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:47,570
haven't changed at all.

387
00:21:50,440 --> 00:21:51,200
Jiang,

388
00:21:51,680 --> 00:21:53,310
since we finally got together today,

389
00:21:53,310 --> 00:21:54,270
tell us

390
00:21:54,310 --> 00:21:56,030
where you've been for the past five years

391
00:21:56,030 --> 00:21:57,560
and what you've been doing.

392
00:22:07,200 --> 00:22:07,920
I...

393
00:22:10,510 --> 00:22:12,370
Something happened in my family.

394
00:22:13,200 --> 00:22:15,060
You might have heard about it too.

395
00:22:16,230 --> 00:22:17,490
I didn't go to college.

396
00:22:19,200 --> 00:22:21,200
My family owed a lot of money back then.

397
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:21,830
I was...

398
00:22:22,510 --> 00:22:24,750
taking odd jobs to pay off the debt.

399
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:38,240
But don't worry.

400
00:22:38,680 --> 00:22:40,010
It's almost sorted now.

401
00:22:40,440 --> 00:22:43,510
I also got a bachelor's degree
through self-study exams.

402
00:22:43,510 --> 00:22:44,910
That's exactly why we say

403
00:22:45,240 --> 00:22:47,440
you can do anything you set your mind to.

404
00:22:48,680 --> 00:22:50,610
What are your plans for the future?

405
00:22:51,440 --> 00:22:52,700
I haven't decided yet.

406
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:55,240
I guess I'll continue studying.

407
00:22:56,000 --> 00:22:57,000
These past years,

408
00:22:57,440 --> 00:22:58,840
I've made you guys worry.

409
00:22:59,310 --> 00:23:00,440
I'm really sorry.

410
00:23:01,720 --> 00:23:02,920
Don't think too much.

411
00:23:03,400 --> 00:23:04,160
It's fine.

412
00:23:07,150 --> 00:23:07,820
By the way,

413
00:23:08,200 --> 00:23:10,330
I brought gifts for you guys this time.

414
00:23:12,200 --> 00:23:13,160
Gifts?

415
00:23:14,720 --> 00:23:15,440
Shen.

416
00:23:16,070 --> 00:23:17,270
What good gift did you get me?

417
00:23:17,270 --> 00:23:18,400
Hurry up and show me.

418
00:23:18,680 --> 00:23:19,480
Here they are.

419
00:23:25,730 --> 00:23:26,680
This is a book, right?

420
00:23:26,680 --> 00:23:28,000
It's heavy and solid.

421
00:23:28,510 --> 00:23:29,510
No need to guess.

422
00:23:30,750 --> 00:23:31,550
It's for me?

423
00:23:34,510 --> 00:23:36,510
This isn't that collection album, is it?

424
00:23:36,510 --> 00:23:37,440
You found it?

425
00:23:37,830 --> 00:23:38,590
I did.

426
00:23:39,240 --> 00:23:40,200
Thanks.

427
00:23:41,590 --> 00:23:43,450
This is a bag of cosmetics, right?

428
00:23:44,790 --> 00:23:45,590
Tang.

429
00:23:45,830 --> 00:23:47,510
Thanks, my dear Shen.

430
00:23:47,510 --> 00:23:48,510
You really get me.

431
00:23:54,750 --> 00:23:57,610
The latest 4th-generation
handheld game console.

432
00:23:58,680 --> 00:23:59,740
No way, seriously?

433
00:24:00,440 --> 00:24:01,700
What's so surprising?

434
00:24:02,000 --> 00:24:04,510
This hasn't even been released
in the country yet.

435
00:24:04,510 --> 00:24:05,920
You're such a good friend.

436
00:24:05,920 --> 00:24:06,920
Thanks, Shen.

437
00:24:10,680 --> 00:24:11,510
Sorry.

438
00:24:11,960 --> 00:24:13,550
I didn't know you were coming, so...

439
00:24:13,550 --> 00:24:14,240
It's fine.

440
00:24:15,920 --> 00:24:17,650
I'll make it up to you next time.

441
00:24:31,200 --> 00:24:33,510
I noticed you've been wearing that watch
for a long time,

442
00:24:33,510 --> 00:24:35,830
so I bought you the latest model.

443
00:24:37,240 --> 00:24:38,000
Take a look.

444
00:24:41,030 --> 00:24:42,200
It's so pretty.

445
00:24:43,830 --> 00:24:44,960
Thank you, Dr. Shen.

446
00:24:47,400 --> 00:24:49,460
I'll definitely take good care of it.

447
00:25:07,510 --> 00:25:09,000
Alright, since Shen is back

448
00:25:09,000 --> 00:25:10,460
and Jiang has rejoined us,

449
00:25:10,680 --> 00:25:11,790
let's have a toast together.

450
00:25:11,790 --> 00:25:12,850
-Cheers!
-Come on.

451
00:25:13,310 --> 00:25:14,160
Lin Zhixia.

452
00:25:15,680 --> 00:25:17,610
Aren't you going to say something?

453
00:25:27,510 --> 00:25:28,510
What's past

454
00:25:29,200 --> 00:25:30,070
is prologue.

455
00:25:32,680 --> 00:25:33,920
Well said, Zhixia.

456
00:25:34,030 --> 00:25:35,510
What's past

457
00:25:35,750 --> 00:25:37,430
is prologue.

458
00:25:37,550 --> 00:25:38,920
Come on, cheers!

459
00:25:54,000 --> 00:25:56,130
This reunion dinner after years apart

460
00:25:56,960 --> 00:25:59,350
was a test for all of us.

461
00:26:01,960 --> 00:26:05,090
When Jiang Yubai finally
gathered the courage to speak,

462
00:26:05,240 --> 00:26:07,680
all my worries dissolved into thin air.

463
00:26:10,110 --> 00:26:11,920
No one pressed him for details,

464
00:26:12,400 --> 00:26:15,060
and he didn't need to
go out of his way to explain.

465
00:26:15,880 --> 00:26:17,680
Our care and understanding

466
00:26:18,160 --> 00:26:19,110
gave all the pain

467
00:26:19,110 --> 00:26:21,480
he could never speak of
a safe place to land.

468
00:26:21,480 --> 00:26:23,940
It felt like nothing had changed
between us.

469
00:26:24,550 --> 00:26:26,950
We were still the same as
when we were young.

470
00:26:39,160 --> 00:26:39,590
Tang.

471
00:26:40,920 --> 00:26:43,090
We're headed the same way.
Let's go home together.

472
00:26:43,090 --> 00:26:44,100
Same way, my foot.

473
00:26:44,240 --> 00:26:45,240
My place is right nearby.

474
00:26:45,240 --> 00:26:46,770
It's only a 10-minute walk.

475
00:26:46,790 --> 00:26:48,390
Go do whatever you need to do.

476
00:26:49,200 --> 00:26:50,440
But seriously,

477
00:26:50,830 --> 00:26:52,440
I was really surprised

478
00:26:52,680 --> 00:26:54,160
to see Jiang today.

479
00:26:54,830 --> 00:26:55,720
What?

480
00:26:56,070 --> 00:26:57,750
You're not happy to see him?

481
00:26:58,160 --> 00:26:59,310
How could I not be happy?

482
00:26:59,310 --> 00:27:00,640
We're all good friends.

483
00:27:01,510 --> 00:27:02,960
I just think... well...

484
00:27:03,920 --> 00:27:05,790
Jiang is really stubborn.

485
00:27:06,270 --> 00:27:07,680
It's just some debt.

486
00:27:07,920 --> 00:27:09,440
He didn't have to disappear for so long.

487
00:27:09,440 --> 00:27:10,790
He could've just told us,

488
00:27:10,790 --> 00:27:13,520
and we would've helped him
figure something out.

489
00:27:13,680 --> 00:27:14,790
What do you know?

490
00:27:15,160 --> 00:27:16,920
That's what a real man is.

491
00:27:17,270 --> 00:27:18,240
If it were you,

492
00:27:18,440 --> 00:27:19,510
you'd be making a huge fuss,

493
00:27:19,510 --> 00:27:20,920
wailing about it to the whole world.

494
00:27:20,920 --> 00:27:22,270
No way.

495
00:27:24,190 --> 00:27:25,590
But it's quite good now.

496
00:27:25,750 --> 00:27:27,680
We're all back together again.

497
00:27:28,160 --> 00:27:28,920
Perfect!

498
00:27:30,920 --> 00:27:31,850
I don't think so.

499
00:27:32,240 --> 00:27:34,680
I have a feeling trouble is coming.

500
00:27:35,550 --> 00:27:36,440
What?

501
00:27:36,720 --> 00:27:38,760
Didn't you notice at dinner today

502
00:27:38,830 --> 00:27:40,960
that Jiang Yubai and Shen Fuxuan
seemed a little off

503
00:27:40,960 --> 00:27:42,070
with each other?

504
00:27:42,070 --> 00:27:42,750
Off?

505
00:27:43,790 --> 00:27:45,680
They've always been like that.

506
00:27:46,720 --> 00:27:48,320
You're the one acting weird.

507
00:27:49,920 --> 00:27:52,050
There's no point explaining it to you.

508
00:27:56,000 --> 00:27:57,270
Didn't you tell me before

509
00:27:57,270 --> 00:27:59,680
that a bunch of investment firms wanted to
fund your bike-sharing project?

510
00:27:59,680 --> 00:28:00,440
Yeah.

511
00:28:00,440 --> 00:28:01,920
Then how come I haven't seen

512
00:28:01,920 --> 00:28:02,920
a single one of your bikes on the road?

513
00:28:02,920 --> 00:28:04,510
Are you just bragging to me?

514
00:28:05,920 --> 00:28:07,720
How could I be bragging?

515
00:28:08,010 --> 00:28:10,520
My e-bikes are just too popular.

516
00:28:10,550 --> 00:28:11,440
Everyone's riding them.

517
00:28:11,440 --> 00:28:13,040
That's why you don't see any.

518
00:28:13,510 --> 00:28:14,240
Oh, please.

519
00:28:14,240 --> 00:28:16,970
Sounds like you just
can't afford to put out more.

520
00:28:17,270 --> 00:28:19,070
You don't know
how the internet business model works,

521
00:28:19,070 --> 00:28:20,270
so stop running your mouth—

522
00:28:20,270 --> 00:28:21,470
especially about me.

523
00:28:22,240 --> 00:28:23,160
What about you?

524
00:28:23,720 --> 00:28:25,510
Didn't you brag to me a few days ago

525
00:28:25,510 --> 00:28:27,510
about how popular the kid
your agency is training has gotten

526
00:28:27,510 --> 00:28:29,200
and how he was about to
join a production crew?

527
00:28:29,200 --> 00:28:30,800
He hasn't joined yet, has he?

528
00:28:32,240 --> 00:28:33,970
Did that project fall through?

529
00:28:34,240 --> 00:28:35,920
What kid?

530
00:28:36,160 --> 00:28:37,960
Look who's talking, old fossil.

531
00:28:38,550 --> 00:28:40,480
Don't think I don't know anything.

532
00:28:40,680 --> 00:28:42,720
Of the kids your agency trains,

533
00:28:42,790 --> 00:28:45,000
not even one in a hundred can make it big.

534
00:28:45,310 --> 00:28:46,720
The best option is for you to go work

535
00:28:46,720 --> 00:28:48,400
with the top actress now.

536
00:28:48,720 --> 00:28:50,070
She has good resources,

537
00:28:50,070 --> 00:28:51,400
and it would help your career.

538
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:53,660
It would also make things easier for you.

539
00:28:55,000 --> 00:28:56,510
Actually, you know what?

540
00:28:56,830 --> 00:28:57,960
My boss did ask me

541
00:28:57,960 --> 00:28:59,590
to manage Bingbing.

542
00:29:00,590 --> 00:29:02,790
He said she's gotten popular recently,
but they're short-staffed

543
00:29:02,790 --> 00:29:04,990
and need a reliable executive manager.

544
00:29:05,070 --> 00:29:06,160
Bingbing?

545
00:29:06,280 --> 00:29:07,410
She's my goddess.

546
00:29:07,440 --> 00:29:09,550
What a great opportunity.
You should take it!

547
00:29:09,550 --> 00:29:11,550
Why are you still thinking about it?

548
00:29:13,790 --> 00:29:15,320
I'm not going to manage her.

549
00:29:15,680 --> 00:29:16,590
You're not?

550
00:29:16,960 --> 00:29:17,750
Why?

551
00:29:18,920 --> 00:29:20,200
No reason.

552
00:29:21,200 --> 00:29:22,070
Su Mo trusts me,

553
00:29:22,070 --> 00:29:23,790
and I believe he can make it big.

554
00:29:23,790 --> 00:29:25,960
I just want to see someone like him grow.

555
00:29:25,960 --> 00:29:27,200
Grow?

556
00:29:27,790 --> 00:29:28,510
Tang Tingting,

557
00:29:28,510 --> 00:29:30,680
have you lost your mind or something?

558
00:29:31,200 --> 00:29:33,400
You're passing up a golden future

559
00:29:33,680 --> 00:29:34,590
for some nobody

560
00:29:34,750 --> 00:29:37,610
who may not even become famous
in a million years...

561
00:29:38,510 --> 00:29:40,840
Do you have feelings for him or something?

562
00:29:41,830 --> 00:29:43,680
Duan Qiyan, I'll manage whoever I want.

563
00:29:43,680 --> 00:29:44,720
And I can have feelings
for whoever I want.

564
00:29:44,720 --> 00:29:46,380
That's none of your business!

565
00:29:47,160 --> 00:29:47,920
Ridiculous.

566
00:29:56,510 --> 00:29:57,370
Jiang Yubai...

567
00:29:58,440 --> 00:29:59,900
You found him, didn't you?

568
00:30:01,790 --> 00:30:02,680
I knew it.

569
00:30:03,720 --> 00:30:05,400
Only you could bring him back.

570
00:30:07,510 --> 00:30:08,640
These past few years

571
00:30:09,030 --> 00:30:10,890
must've been really rough on him.

572
00:30:16,510 --> 00:30:17,720
But it's all over now,

573
00:30:18,000 --> 00:30:19,080
isn't it?

574
00:30:21,270 --> 00:30:22,800
Have you ever thought about

575
00:30:22,920 --> 00:30:24,920
what you would've done if you hadn't

576
00:30:25,200 --> 00:30:26,330
found him this time?

577
00:30:26,720 --> 00:30:28,120
I would've kept looking.

578
00:30:28,240 --> 00:30:29,030
For how long?

579
00:30:29,400 --> 00:30:30,530
Until I'd found him.

580
00:30:34,830 --> 00:30:36,360
He must have had his reasons

581
00:30:36,750 --> 00:30:37,920
for not showing up.

582
00:30:38,510 --> 00:30:39,440
But I believe

583
00:30:39,960 --> 00:30:41,420
he would never abandon us.

584
00:30:49,030 --> 00:30:50,430
We really are different.

585
00:30:54,440 --> 00:30:55,680
You're an optimist.

586
00:30:58,510 --> 00:30:59,370
I'm going home.

587
00:31:00,220 --> 00:31:01,420
-Bye-bye.
-Bye-bye.

588
00:31:17,290 --> 00:31:26,800
[Class Break]

589
00:31:18,030 --> 00:31:19,030
Jiang is back on the team.

590
00:31:19,030 --> 00:31:20,760
We're finally complete again!

591
00:31:21,350 --> 00:31:23,200
Happy! We made it home safely!

592
00:31:33,150 --> 00:31:42,020
[Class Break]

593
00:31:38,750 --> 00:31:39,550
Welcome back.

594
00:32:01,600 --> 00:32:04,100
[Class Break]

595
00:32:06,450 --> 00:32:06,780
[Class Break]

596
00:32:06,780 --> 00:32:10,850
[Yubai]

597
00:32:22,840 --> 00:32:27,560
[Yubai]

598
00:32:31,920 --> 00:32:32,580
Good night.

599
00:32:40,750 --> 00:32:41,680
Sweet dreams.

600
00:33:06,400 --> 00:33:08,600
Manager Xie, please make an exception.

601
00:33:08,920 --> 00:33:12,240
Our project really needs the supercomputer
to process the data.

602
00:33:12,240 --> 00:33:13,920
That priority project you just mentioned—

603
00:33:13,920 --> 00:33:15,380
isn't that Tan Qianche's?

604
00:33:15,720 --> 00:33:17,170
He's not trying to catch up
on the schedule at all.

605
00:33:17,170 --> 00:33:18,550
He's just hogging the machine on purpose

606
00:33:18,550 --> 00:33:19,550
so we can't use it.

607
00:33:20,510 --> 00:33:22,460
Don't say such things to others.

608
00:33:22,920 --> 00:33:24,380
Team Leader Tan's project

609
00:33:24,400 --> 00:33:25,940
has always been the university's

610
00:33:25,940 --> 00:33:27,790
top-priority project this semester.

611
00:33:27,790 --> 00:33:28,510
Yes.

612
00:33:28,750 --> 00:33:30,590
It has reached a critical stage again,

613
00:33:30,590 --> 00:33:32,680
so it's understandable for him
to try to get back on schedule.

614
00:33:32,680 --> 00:33:34,920
But we booked the time slots long ago.

615
00:33:35,070 --> 00:33:36,510
Why can't we use it?

616
00:33:38,180 --> 00:33:39,750
That doesn't count anymore.

617
00:33:39,750 --> 00:33:40,920
Starting today,

618
00:33:40,920 --> 00:33:43,680
Team Leader Tan's project has exclusive use
of the supercomputer room 24/7.

619
00:33:43,680 --> 00:33:44,680
This is a decision made by the department.

620
00:33:44,680 --> 00:33:45,310
Then...

621
00:33:45,330 --> 00:33:47,420
Alright, don't waste your time here.

622
00:33:47,550 --> 00:33:48,950
There's nothing I can do.

623
00:33:50,960 --> 00:33:53,240
Tan Qianche is being way too unreasonable.

624
00:33:53,240 --> 00:33:54,200
I know him.

625
00:33:54,270 --> 00:33:55,200
As long as he wants to,

626
00:33:55,200 --> 00:33:56,920
he can block every path for us.

627
00:33:57,070 --> 00:34:00,200
Unless we stop using
any of the university's resources.

628
00:34:00,200 --> 00:34:02,440
But without the university's resources,

629
00:34:02,440 --> 00:34:04,510
where else are we supposed to turn?

630
00:34:08,590 --> 00:34:10,790
I'm definitely going to graduate late.

631
00:34:12,440 --> 00:34:14,960
Enough. What's the use of complaining?

632
00:34:15,510 --> 00:34:17,310
Let's listen to the team leader.

633
00:34:18,360 --> 00:34:19,110
Team Leader,

634
00:34:20,280 --> 00:34:21,540
do you have a solution?

635
00:34:23,960 --> 00:34:25,820
I've given it some rough thought.

636
00:34:26,550 --> 00:34:29,400
If we divide the core data
that needs to be run by the supercomputer

637
00:34:29,400 --> 00:34:30,360
into modules,

638
00:34:31,150 --> 00:34:33,150
then we need to evaluate two things:

639
00:34:34,040 --> 00:34:36,170
first, whether regular equipment can

640
00:34:36,190 --> 00:34:38,250
handle the modules after splitting;

641
00:34:38,360 --> 00:34:40,280
and second, how much data transfer

642
00:34:40,280 --> 00:34:41,880
occurs between the modules.

643
00:34:43,070 --> 00:34:45,360
If we can solve those two problems,

644
00:34:46,030 --> 00:34:47,920
we won't need the supercomputer—

645
00:34:48,440 --> 00:34:49,440
we can compute the parts separately

646
00:34:49,440 --> 00:34:51,500
and integrate the results at the end.

647
00:34:52,440 --> 00:34:53,370
That could work.

648
00:34:55,030 --> 00:34:55,960
If

649
00:34:56,360 --> 00:34:58,320
we use ordinary computers

650
00:34:58,510 --> 00:34:59,910
to run the AI algorithms,

651
00:34:59,920 --> 00:35:00,800
it should work.

652
00:35:01,150 --> 00:35:03,110
Zhixia, I knew you'd have a way.

653
00:35:03,110 --> 00:35:03,880
Luo Ying,

654
00:35:04,280 --> 00:35:05,360
but this algorithm is far too

655
00:35:05,360 --> 00:35:07,440
demanding for the people who operate it.

656
00:35:07,440 --> 00:35:09,840
Only you and Team Leader Lin
can pull it off.

657
00:35:10,000 --> 00:35:11,320
A weakling like me

658
00:35:11,400 --> 00:35:13,130
would just mess it up if I tried.

659
00:35:14,510 --> 00:35:15,710
Still, we have to try.

660
00:35:15,880 --> 00:35:17,610
There's no other way right now.

661
00:35:18,510 --> 00:35:19,960
Otherwise, we'll just have to watch

662
00:35:19,960 --> 00:35:21,420
our project fall through.

663
00:35:21,630 --> 00:35:23,430
We'll have nowhere else to turn,

664
00:35:23,630 --> 00:35:25,960
and Shuwen's graduation will be delayed.

665
00:35:27,190 --> 00:35:28,360
So we can't give up.

666
00:35:29,400 --> 00:35:30,190
Right.

667
00:35:30,510 --> 00:35:32,040
Don't be so down, everyone.

668
00:35:32,430 --> 00:35:34,880
Isn't Tan Qianche just waiting to
laugh at us?

669
00:35:34,880 --> 00:35:37,190
The more discouraged we are,
the more smug he gets.

670
00:35:37,190 --> 00:35:38,920
Don't let him get what he wants.

671
00:35:39,630 --> 00:35:41,960
Forget it. Quit trying to hype me up.

672
00:35:42,150 --> 00:35:43,190
Just think about it—

673
00:35:43,190 --> 00:35:45,000
how many times more work is this

674
00:35:45,000 --> 00:35:46,800
without the supercomputer?

675
00:35:47,110 --> 00:35:49,370
Just thinking about it makes me despair.

676
00:36:13,110 --> 00:36:13,880
Shui.

677
00:36:16,150 --> 00:36:17,510
Are you hurting again?

678
00:36:18,000 --> 00:36:19,000
Leave me alone.

679
00:36:21,880 --> 00:36:22,960
I'll call Dr. Huang.

680
00:36:22,960 --> 00:36:23,710
Don't.

681
00:36:27,110 --> 00:36:29,510
I know it's his daughter's birthday today.

682
00:36:32,110 --> 00:36:33,880
I don't want to disappoint her.

683
00:36:44,880 --> 00:36:45,940
What are you doing?

684
00:36:46,440 --> 00:36:48,640
Aren't you going to check the next ward?

685
00:36:49,070 --> 00:36:50,270
Yours is the last one.

686
00:36:54,140 --> 00:36:56,000
I'm no good at comforting people.

687
00:36:56,390 --> 00:36:58,250
I'll just sit with you for a while.

688
00:37:18,400 --> 00:37:19,800
Don't just sit there.

689
00:37:20,710 --> 00:37:22,110
Say something.

690
00:37:23,320 --> 00:37:24,880
Distract me a little.

691
00:37:26,920 --> 00:37:28,250
I don't know what to say.

692
00:37:30,630 --> 00:37:33,000
Anything is fine.

693
00:37:34,630 --> 00:37:36,230
Even if you just make a sound.

694
00:37:41,440 --> 00:37:42,510
Please.

695
00:37:48,190 --> 00:37:51,070
Cell reprogramming
and transdifferentiation

696
00:37:51,800 --> 00:37:53,590
are among the key research areas

697
00:37:53,590 --> 00:37:55,150
in regenerative medicine.

698
00:37:55,880 --> 00:37:57,710
This guy really is something.

699
00:38:04,320 --> 00:38:07,190
"The late emperor was taken from us
before he could finish his life's work.

700
00:38:07,190 --> 00:38:08,770
Now, this world is divided into three,

701
00:38:08,770 --> 00:38:10,000
and Yi Province is in dire straits.

702
00:38:10,000 --> 00:38:12,710
This is truly a critical moment
of survival or ruin.

703
00:38:12,710 --> 00:38:14,630
They remember the generous treatment
they received from the late emperor,

704
00:38:14,630 --> 00:38:18,290
and they wish to repay his kindness
by serving Your Majesty well."

705
00:38:18,550 --> 00:38:19,880
Once upon a time,

706
00:38:20,360 --> 00:38:23,030
there was a little match girl.

707
00:38:24,920 --> 00:38:25,590
She...

708
00:38:27,960 --> 00:38:29,880
She was out selling matches,

709
00:38:30,280 --> 00:38:32,280
but no one wanted to buy them.

710
00:38:33,070 --> 00:38:33,880
And then...

711
00:39:22,630 --> 00:39:24,960
As soon as they heard about
splitting the data,

712
00:39:24,960 --> 00:39:27,290
the team members all started backing out.

713
00:39:27,590 --> 00:39:28,310
Really?

714
00:39:30,770 --> 00:39:33,440
Shuwen is so worried he won't
graduate on time that he's panicking.

715
00:39:33,440 --> 00:39:34,510
Shasha too.

716
00:39:34,510 --> 00:39:36,710
She has no confidence in herself at all.

717
00:39:39,630 --> 00:39:40,920
I understand them.

718
00:39:41,960 --> 00:39:43,800
But for our project to continue,

719
00:39:43,800 --> 00:39:44,930
this is the only way.

720
00:39:46,730 --> 00:39:48,330
Pass me the insulating tape.

721
00:39:53,800 --> 00:39:55,840
Senior Luo Ying left Tan Qianche's team

722
00:39:55,840 --> 00:39:57,440
for my project.

723
00:39:58,710 --> 00:40:00,630
I must get this project done.

724
00:40:01,000 --> 00:40:03,330
Otherwise, I'd feel like I'd failed them.

725
00:40:04,150 --> 00:40:05,550
Get me 10 more screws.

726
00:40:10,590 --> 00:40:11,460
Later,

727
00:40:11,590 --> 00:40:14,110
I need to have a serious talk
with Shasha and Shuwen.

728
00:40:14,110 --> 00:40:16,310
Based on their individual situations,

729
00:40:16,320 --> 00:40:17,920
I'll adjust the project plan

730
00:40:18,510 --> 00:40:20,970
and lower the difficulty
for Shasha's part.

731
00:40:35,510 --> 00:40:36,970
Am I disturbing your work?

732
00:40:37,050 --> 00:40:38,010
Of course not.

733
00:40:38,960 --> 00:40:40,820
Pass me the screwdriver. Thanks.

734
00:40:43,880 --> 00:40:44,880
Which one?

735
00:40:45,400 --> 00:40:46,660
The one on the far left.

736
00:40:48,710 --> 00:40:49,920
The supercomputer room has been occupied.

737
00:40:49,920 --> 00:40:51,320
Everyone is in a bad mood,

738
00:40:51,630 --> 00:40:53,090
and it's affecting me too.

739
00:40:53,510 --> 00:40:54,770
I don't know what to do.

740
00:40:57,360 --> 00:40:58,710
Didn't you just say it?

741
00:40:59,150 --> 00:41:00,510
Talk to them first,

742
00:41:00,960 --> 00:41:02,590
understand their specific situations,

743
00:41:02,590 --> 00:41:03,720
and then make a plan.

744
00:41:04,710 --> 00:41:05,710
You're so smart.

745
00:41:05,730 --> 00:41:07,280
You can solve any problem.

746
00:41:07,960 --> 00:41:09,110
So right now,

747
00:41:09,150 --> 00:41:12,110
I'm only concerned about
your mood and emotional well-being.

748
00:41:12,110 --> 00:41:13,630
After all,
even the smartest person's efficiency

749
00:41:13,630 --> 00:41:14,880
can suffer

750
00:41:15,070 --> 00:41:16,670
when they're in a bad mood.

751
00:41:19,670 --> 00:41:20,550
You're right.

752
00:41:20,840 --> 00:41:23,190
My mood is affecting my work right now.

753
00:41:24,670 --> 00:41:28,130
I shouldn't have let other people's moods
affect me like this.

754
00:41:30,880 --> 00:41:32,360
Then do you have any way

755
00:41:32,360 --> 00:41:33,620
to make me feel better?

756
00:41:45,190 --> 00:41:46,650
When you're feeling down,

757
00:41:47,400 --> 00:41:48,660
have something sweet.

758
00:41:57,190 --> 00:41:58,110
It's so sweet.

759
00:42:00,440 --> 00:42:01,300
How about this?

760
00:42:01,710 --> 00:42:03,710
Take this whole box back to your lab.

761
00:42:03,840 --> 00:42:06,040
Whenever you're feeling down, eat one.

762
00:42:07,360 --> 00:42:08,000
Thank you.

763
00:42:24,250 --> 00:42:27,710
[Results Integration: Lin Zhixia]

764
00:42:27,740 --> 00:42:34,260
[Data Splitting: Luo Ying]

765
00:42:33,400 --> 00:42:34,150
Zhixia.

766
00:42:35,150 --> 00:42:37,710
Are you really going to
take on most of the computing tasks?

767
00:42:37,710 --> 00:42:39,190
I can help you more with that.

768
00:42:39,190 --> 00:42:39,840
Do you...

769
00:42:39,840 --> 00:42:40,590
It's fine.

770
00:42:40,670 --> 00:42:42,500
[Results Integration: Lin Zhixia]

771
00:42:41,710 --> 00:42:43,110
Just stick to your assigned tasks.

772
00:42:42,530 --> 00:42:44,690
[Data Splitting: Luo Ying]

773
00:42:56,110 --> 00:42:58,070
CL is 0.3170, right?

774
00:42:58,070 --> 00:42:58,590
But...

775
00:42:58,840 --> 00:42:59,550
your...

776
00:43:04,070 --> 00:43:05,800
Team Leader, here is my report.

777
00:43:05,960 --> 00:43:06,690
Team Leader.

778
00:43:07,440 --> 00:43:08,190
Good job.

779
00:43:10,000 --> 00:43:12,060
I've finished all the calculations.

780
00:43:13,070 --> 00:43:13,710
Zhixia.

781
00:43:14,550 --> 00:43:15,800
Don't work too late by yourself.

782
00:43:15,800 --> 00:43:16,280
Okay.

783
00:43:16,280 --> 00:43:17,280
Remember to rest.

784
00:43:25,880 --> 00:43:27,360
Enter this data for me.

785
00:43:27,510 --> 00:43:28,110
Okay.

786
00:43:28,150 --> 00:43:28,960
Shasha.

787
00:43:32,880 --> 00:43:35,360
I've proved that the curve of 129 and Y

788
00:43:35,360 --> 00:43:36,840
equals the curve of X2.

789
00:43:36,840 --> 00:43:38,710
But you haven't calculated this value.

790
00:43:38,710 --> 00:43:39,360
Actually, we can...

791
00:43:39,360 --> 00:43:42,030
Are the values
for sections 3 and 4 accurate?

792
00:43:50,190 --> 00:43:52,120
I ordered bubble tea for everyone.

793
00:43:52,190 --> 00:43:52,840
Here.

794
00:43:53,960 --> 00:43:54,670
Thank you.

795
00:43:54,670 --> 00:43:55,600
You're welcome.

796
00:43:56,590 --> 00:43:57,320
Team Leader.

797
00:44:01,030 --> 00:44:01,710
Thank you.

798
00:44:01,710 --> 00:44:02,640
You're welcome.

799
00:44:02,670 --> 00:44:03,800
You're the best.

800
00:44:04,710 --> 00:44:05,630
Thank you.

801
00:44:09,590 --> 00:44:10,360
Luo Ying.

802
00:44:10,630 --> 00:44:12,070
Okay, thanks. I'll drink it later.

803
00:44:12,070 --> 00:44:12,710
Okay.

804
00:44:16,840 --> 00:44:18,040
Everyone, keep it up!

805
00:44:18,510 --> 00:44:19,400
-We can do it!
-Keep going.

806
00:44:19,400 --> 00:44:20,150
Keep going.

807
00:44:29,740 --> 00:44:34,680
[Mom]

808
00:44:30,000 --> 00:44:32,670
Baihui, you said
you'd come home for dinner this weekend.

809
00:44:32,670 --> 00:44:33,930
Come back early today.

810
00:44:43,030 --> 00:44:44,260
Did you see my message?

811
00:44:43,310 --> 00:44:48,360
[Mom]

812
00:44:44,590 --> 00:44:46,050
What time will you be home?

813
00:45:12,710 --> 00:45:13,550
Hello, Mom.

814
00:45:13,840 --> 00:45:15,900
Didn't you see the message I sent you?

815
00:45:16,630 --> 00:45:17,360
I saw it.

816
00:45:17,360 --> 00:45:18,510
Um, I'm in class.

817
00:45:18,510 --> 00:45:20,510
I'll go back as soon as class is over.

818
00:45:20,590 --> 00:45:21,030
Okay.

819
00:45:21,230 --> 00:45:22,550
I'll tell your dad too.

820
00:45:22,880 --> 00:45:23,880
What do you want to eat?

821
00:45:23,880 --> 00:45:25,150
I'll go buy the ingredients later.

822
00:45:25,150 --> 00:45:26,150
Anything is fine.

823
00:45:26,360 --> 00:45:26,890
Alright.

824
00:45:41,710 --> 00:45:42,670
Chicken soup ramen, right?

825
00:45:42,670 --> 00:45:44,280
They make it pretty well.

826
00:45:44,300 --> 00:45:45,130
I think so.

827
00:45:45,880 --> 00:45:46,810
What did you say?

828
00:45:46,840 --> 00:45:48,960
-The plan still needs further discussion.
-Please, wait a minute.

829
00:45:48,960 --> 00:45:50,920
Right, if we're going to do this,
make it perfect.

830
00:45:50,920 --> 00:45:51,440
Right.

831
00:45:51,440 --> 00:45:53,440
Welcome. What would you like to eat?

832
00:45:53,920 --> 00:45:55,510
I'll definitely
have noodles again this time.

833
00:45:55,510 --> 00:45:57,280
But the one I had last time
tasted pretty good.

834
00:45:57,280 --> 00:45:59,550
This time, I'll try
the chicken soup one instead.

835
00:45:59,550 --> 00:46:00,320
Oh, right.

836
00:46:00,840 --> 00:46:02,440
Please put less soy sauce,

837
00:46:02,440 --> 00:46:04,150
no green onions, and no crispy seaweed.

838
00:46:04,150 --> 00:46:06,280
Also, an extra soft-boiled egg

839
00:46:06,280 --> 00:46:07,610
and some char siu for me.

840
00:46:07,920 --> 00:46:08,800
Okay. What about you?

841
00:46:08,800 --> 00:46:10,260
I'll have a regular ramen.

842
00:46:10,880 --> 00:46:12,880
So that's one regular ramen

843
00:46:12,880 --> 00:46:14,070
and one chicken soup ramen

844
00:46:14,070 --> 00:46:16,030
with no green onions or crispy seaweed,

845
00:46:16,030 --> 00:46:17,150
less soy sauce,

846
00:46:17,360 --> 00:46:19,280
plus a soft-boiled egg and char siu,

847
00:46:19,280 --> 00:46:19,880
right?

848
00:46:19,880 --> 00:46:20,920
Right, thanks.

849
00:46:21,110 --> 00:46:21,800
Okay.

850
00:46:24,150 --> 00:46:24,960
Um,

851
00:46:25,150 --> 00:46:26,920
3 bottles of soy milk for me.

852
00:46:27,190 --> 00:46:28,710
Sure, coming right up.

853
00:46:31,030 --> 00:46:31,920
So, the most important issue

854
00:46:31,920 --> 00:46:33,230
about that plan is...

855
00:46:53,440 --> 00:46:54,750
Make sure to rest
no matter how busy you are.

856
00:46:54,750 --> 00:46:58,060
[Jiang Yubai]

857
00:46:59,230 --> 00:47:01,660
[Yubai]

858
00:47:01,700 --> 00:47:02,730
[Jiang Yubai]

859
00:47:12,360 --> 00:47:13,110
Your ramen.

860
00:47:13,110 --> 00:47:13,840
Thank you.

861
00:47:14,280 --> 00:47:15,000
Your chicken soup ramen.

862
00:47:15,000 --> 00:47:15,550
Thanks.

863
00:47:15,550 --> 00:47:16,280
Mr. Duan, about...

864
00:47:16,280 --> 00:47:16,960
Hold on.

865
00:47:17,070 --> 00:47:18,000
Let's eat first.

866
00:47:18,070 --> 00:47:19,670
We need a full stomach
to have the energy to fight.

867
00:47:19,670 --> 00:47:21,280
If you're not into food,
you've got a problem.

868
00:47:21,280 --> 00:47:22,190
We can talk while we eat.

869
00:47:22,190 --> 00:47:23,800
Plus, the ramen the boss lady makes here

870
00:47:23,800 --> 00:47:25,460
is exceptionally delicious.

871
00:47:26,150 --> 00:47:27,550
Enjoy your meal, then.

872
00:47:27,800 --> 00:47:28,600
Wait a minute.

873
00:47:30,190 --> 00:47:32,190
Have a bottle of soy milk, boss lady.

874
00:47:33,670 --> 00:47:34,800
For me?

875
00:47:35,590 --> 00:47:37,850
Thanks for putting up with my fussiness.

876
00:47:40,670 --> 00:47:41,880
I'll accept it then.

877
00:47:45,320 --> 00:47:46,070
Actually...

878
00:47:47,150 --> 00:47:49,360
what you just suggested
definitely won't work.

879
00:47:49,360 --> 00:47:50,110
Why?

880
00:47:50,110 --> 00:47:53,240
We absolutely can't settle for
a second-best solution.

881
00:47:59,550 --> 00:48:01,630
But the KPIs are already set in stone.

882
00:48:02,840 --> 00:48:04,000
Technological upgrades

883
00:48:04,000 --> 00:48:06,000
are what we must strive for.

884
00:48:06,630 --> 00:48:08,150
You can't just focus on short-term gains

885
00:48:08,150 --> 00:48:09,030
and ignore the big picture.

886
00:48:09,030 --> 00:48:11,160
That doesn't make sense. Understand?

887
00:48:11,840 --> 00:48:13,710
Mr. Duan, actually, I support your idea.

888
00:48:13,710 --> 00:48:15,440
But the other shareholders...

889
00:48:15,440 --> 00:48:16,510
Don't worry about the others.

890
00:48:16,510 --> 00:48:17,710
You help me
stabilize things on their side.

891
00:48:17,710 --> 00:48:18,910
I'll handle the rest.

892
00:48:19,360 --> 00:48:20,110
Eat up.

893
00:48:20,110 --> 00:48:21,110
Okay, okay, okay.

894
00:48:22,880 --> 00:48:24,550
I understand your thoughts,

895
00:48:24,880 --> 00:48:26,810
but the most important thing is...

896
00:49:06,920 --> 00:49:07,710
Zhixia.

897
00:49:10,280 --> 00:49:11,070
You're here.

898
00:49:11,710 --> 00:49:13,040
Why are your eyes so red?

899
00:49:14,000 --> 00:49:15,670
You really can't keep
pulling all-nighters like this.

900
00:49:15,670 --> 00:49:18,000
Your body will give out
if you keep this up.

901
00:49:18,510 --> 00:49:20,370
So I'm going home to rest for a bit.

902
00:49:20,900 --> 00:49:23,070
Can you keep an eye on
the progress this morning?

903
00:49:23,070 --> 00:49:24,920
You're already like this.
Don't worry about those things.

904
00:49:24,920 --> 00:49:25,980
I'll take you home.

905
00:49:27,070 --> 00:49:29,270
I'll be worried if you're not in the lab.

906
00:49:29,800 --> 00:49:30,590
Fine.

907
00:49:30,670 --> 00:49:32,190
Hurry back and get some sleep.

908
00:49:32,190 --> 00:49:33,000
Bye.

909
00:49:48,590 --> 00:49:49,280
Zhixia!

910
00:49:51,070 --> 00:49:51,800
Zhixia!

911
00:49:59,810 --> 00:50:00,140
[Class Break]

912
00:50:01,230 --> 00:50:02,360
Zhixia fell down.

913
00:50:02,400 --> 00:50:03,860
She's in the hospital now.

914
00:50:19,920 --> 00:50:20,630
How is she?

915
00:50:20,840 --> 00:50:21,730
Is she alright?

916
00:50:22,320 --> 00:50:23,320
There's nothing serious.

917
00:50:23,320 --> 00:50:24,960
Just dizziness from extreme fatigue,

918
00:50:24,960 --> 00:50:25,760
a hairline fracture in her foot,

919
00:50:25,760 --> 00:50:26,820
and a slight fever.

920
00:50:26,880 --> 00:50:28,280
She'll be fine after a couple of days' rest
in the hospital.

921
00:50:28,280 --> 00:50:29,880
That sounds pretty serious.

922
00:50:30,070 --> 00:50:31,480
Can we go in and see her?

923
00:50:32,750 --> 00:50:33,800
The hospital has rules.

924
00:50:33,800 --> 00:50:35,150
Only one visit per day,

925
00:50:35,280 --> 00:50:37,280
and a maximum of two people at a time.

926
00:50:43,280 --> 00:50:44,880
There's still one spot left.

927
00:50:45,760 --> 00:50:46,550
Let me go in.
